Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:03.00,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}字幕製作：測試樣本組
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:06.20,Han,,0,0,0,,你今天怎麼這麼早就起來了\N{\rEN}Why are you up so early today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:09.00,Han,,0,0,0,,我睡不著 乾脆起來煮點咖啡\N{\rEN}I couldn't sleep, so I figured I'd make some coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:12.80,Han,,0,0,0,,你要不要也來一杯 我煮了一大壺\N夠我們兩個人喝一整個上午\N{\rEN}Do you want a cup too? I made a big pot, enough for both of us to drink all morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:15.00,Han,,0,0,0,,好啊 - 加不加糖\N{\rEN}- Sure. - Sugar?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:21.50,Han,,0,0,0,,樓下那家店的手機殼打八折\N我昨天順手買了一個\N{\rEN}The shop downstairs has phone cases at 20% off, so I grabbed one yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:25.00,Han,,0,0,0,,一共是128.50元 比網上便宜了差不多30塊\N{\rEN}It came to 128.50 in total, about 30 cheaper than online.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.60,0:00:33.20,Han,,0,0,0,,其實我一直想跟你說 下個月我\N可能要搬到離公司近一點的地方去住\N{\rEN}There's something I've been meaning to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.30,0:00:35.10,Han,,0,0,0,,其實我一直想跟你說 下個月我\N可能要搬到離公司近一點的地方去住\N{\rEN}I might move closer to work next month.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:37.00,Han,,0,0,0,,真的嗎\N{\rEN}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.20,0:00:40.00,Han,,0,0,0,,嗯 每天通勤兩個小時 實在是太累了\N{\rEN}Yeah. Two hours of commuting every day is just too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.60,0:00:43.60,Lyrics_EN,,0,0,0,,♪ The rain keeps falling outside ♪
